<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Teva raised by Gruntal.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Teva raised by Gruntal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal and Co analyst said David Saks upgraded Israeli-based Teva Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;After our recent field trip with top management in Israel we are even more enthusiastic about Teva's potential and vast strength to post superior growth for many years to come,&quot; a Gruntal report said.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 3/8 at 63-3/4.</p>
